## Original Content
Chinese official calls for more APEC efforts to remove trade barriers

## Summary
A Chinese official has urged APEC to enhance its efforts to eliminate trade barriers, highlighting the importance of regional economic cooperation. The call emphasizes the need for reducing trade obstacles to promote growth in the Asia-Pacific area.

## Key Points
- A Chinese official is advocating for increased APEC involvement in removing trade barriers.
- Trade barriers are presented as a key obstacle to economic development in the Asia-Pacific region.
- APEC is being called upon to play a more active role in facilitating free trade.


